title Cassette bound (CASSETTE_DEMO=1), square screen: a 6 s take on the Edit (trim) page, ZOOM in once, PLAY: the waveform scrolls under the marker with its bars on the take's grid (each bar keeps its height as it moves), the marker followed smoothly, the time ruler inside the panel
sizes 720x720
ppmm 800
env CASSETTE_DEMO 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_HOME demo-home
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 1500
expect text "SOFT"
tap "REC"
wait 6300
tap "STOP"
wait 1000
key l
wait 700
expect text "Take 001"
tap "EDIT"
wait 1500
expect text "TAKE 001"
key up
wait 500
shot trim-zoomed
key space
wait 1200
shot trim-playing-a
wait 300
shot trim-playing-b
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key esc
wait 800
expect text "Take 001"
expect noquit
